  "review_evidence": "Independent fresh primary-first contract preceded current proof, lesson and decoder exposure. All108 frozen current raw/LF inputs and47 retained source/API inputs match. Reviewed the entire production including sole private pullback_energy, complete posterior-cutoff/zero/signed-rank0 Test, seven formula steps and actual qualified dependencies. Recreated exact canonical publication context and digest; all eight decoder binding fields and raw run/initial-lease observations match verbatim. Literal Gaussian law, genuine three L1 domains, chain rule/Riesz/Parseval and constant2 agree with the scoped authored compact background. No compiler or whole-math-verdict evidence used. Original metadata/topology BLOCKED receipts and independently reviewed root representation overlay retained; this is current source fidelity only.",
